    "checklist.menu.copyCheckedItems" : {
      "comment" : "Overflow-menu entry on an existing checklist's detail screen. Copies the items the person has ticked into another checklist, picked on the sheet that opens next. Keep the trailing ellipsis — it is what promises that sheet. It sits directly under the Duplicate Checklist entry and must not read alike: that one copies the whole list, this one copies a selection into a different list. \"to…\" means to a different checklist, never \"here\" or \"into this one\".",
