    "checklist.move.title" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the sheet that asks where to move the items someone has ticked: they are added to the chosen checklist and removed from this one. Reached from the checklist detail screen's Move Checked Items to… menu entry; keep the two consistent, and keep it distinct from checklist.copy.title, which leaves the items where they were.",
